<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Three-Five started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Three-Five started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Furman Selz said it initiated coverage of Three-Five Systems Inc and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- set a price target of $30 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects to see year-over-year sales growth of 39 percent in 1997 and 36 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Three-Five Systems gained 1-1/2 to 21-3/8.</p>
</text>
